Hi,

sorry for late reply.

I *think* I understood what you're asking for. As soon as you have added
a observation spesific intercept you're back in the Poisson world, and
you can do what you want. It is not wise to add something that is
confounded with the observation spesific intercept, but that is not what
you're thinking of doing.

